build	Build with Buildozer	2025-12-29T20:19:25.9877886Z  "# Some runners/environments can't reach archive.apache.org reliably.\n"
build	Build with Buildozer	2025-12-29T20:19:25.9878613Z  '# Install Ant locally (or no-op if already installed) and make sure\n'
