build	Build with Buildozer	2025-12-29T20:19:25.9883709Z  '# The Android Gradle Plugin can run out of heap during packaging (e.g. '
build	Build with Buildozer	2025-12-29T20:19:25.9884258Z  ':packageDebug),\n'
build	Build with Buildozer	2025-12-29T20:19:25.9884737Z  '# especially when bundling large AARs (Agora full-sdk, etc.). Increase '
